#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Bandwidth:</strong> Set the capacity used to calculate utilisation, for example 100M or 1G. K, M, G and T are supported. Select Same As &quot;In&quot; when both directions have equal capacity.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Traffic interface:</strong> Search by device, port or description, or select Browse all. Choose an interface, then click Use interface to set the primary measured source, click destination and main hover graph. Additional measured sources and hover graphs are kept.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Appearance and comments:</strong> Via Style controls curved or angled bends; Link Width controls arrow thickness. IN Comment and OUT Comment add text along each direction. The percentage sets the text position along the link. Comment Style places comments beside the link (Edge) or over the arrow (Centre); Use map default follows Map Style.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Additional hover graphs:</strong> Show a maximum of two hover graphs: the main traffic graph and one extra, such as CPU, latency or another interface. Filter by graph type narrows the choices. Add hover graph adds the extra; Replace hover graphs changes it; Remove graph removes it. The main traffic graph, measured traffic and link click destination stay unchanged. In the viewer, each Cacti preview opens its own full graph when clicked.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced settings:</strong> Optional controls for moving the IN/OUT traffic labels, combining measured sources, changing the click destination and entering custom hover image URLs. Traffic label positions move the utilisation boxes along the link, independently of comment positions. Use map default follows Map Style. A normal traffic link usually needs no changes here.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Combining traffic sources:</strong> Add traffic source adds another interface to the map total, separately for IN and OUT. Remove source removes an additional source. Change the primary source using Use interface at the top. The combined traffic is compared with the configured bandwidth to calculate utilisation. No combined Cacti graph is created automatically; create a matching aggregate graph in Cacti and enter its click and hover URLs if needed. Separate map links are usually clearer for primary and backup connections.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Manual sources and URLs:</strong> The source text box edits the complete measured-source list, including the primary source. Click destination URL controls where clicking the map link goes. Main hover graph URL sets the first preview; Additional graph URL(s) accepts one extra image URL. This extra is also managed under Additional hover graphs.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Tidy and Via:</strong> Tidy adjusts the link layout. Via lets you place a bend point on the map.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Edit Raw Configuration:</strong> Edit the underlying map syntax for settings beyond this form.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Upana wa bendi:</strong> Weka uwezo unaotumika kukokotoa matumizi, kwa mfano 100M au 1G. K, M, G na T zinategemezwa. Chagua Sawa na &quot;Ndani&quot; wakati pande zote mbili zina uwezo sawa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Kiolesura cha trafiki:</strong> Tafuta kwa kifaa, lango au maelezo, au chagua Vinjari zote. Chagua kiolesura, kisha bofya Tumia kiolesura ili kuweka chanzo kikuu kilichopimwa, lengwa la kubofya na grafu kuu ya kuelea. Vyanzo vya ziada vilivyopimwa na grafu za kuelea huhifadhiwa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Mwonekano na maoni:</strong> Mtindo wa Kupitia hudhibiti mikunjo iliyopinda au yenye pembe; Upana wa Kiungo hudhibiti unene wa mshale. Maoni ya NDANI na Maoni ya NJE huongeza maandishi kando ya kila mwelekeo. Asilimia huweka nafasi ya maandishi kando ya kiungo. Mtindo wa Maoni huweka maoni kando ya kiungo (Ukingoni) au juu ya mshale (Katikati); Tumia chaguo-msingi cha ramani hufuata Mtindo wa Ramani.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Grafu za ziada za kuelea:</strong> Onyesha kiwango cha juu cha grafu mbili za kuelea: grafu kuu ya trafiki na moja ya ziada, kama vile CPU, ucheleweshaji au kiolesura kingine. Chuja kwa aina ya grafu hupunguza machaguo. Ongeza grafu ya kuelea huongeza ya ziada; Badilisha grafu za kuelea huibadilisha; Ondoa grafu huiondoa. Grafu kuu ya trafiki, trafiki iliyopimwa na lengwa la kubofya kiungo hubaki bila kubadilika. Katika kitazamaji, kila mwonekano wa awali wa Cacti hufungua grafu yake kamili unapobofywa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Mipangilio ya juu:</strong> Vidhibiti vya hiari vya kusogeza lebo za trafiki za NDANI/NJE, kuunganisha vyanzo vilivyopimwa, kubadilisha lengwa la kubofya na kuweka URL maalum za picha za kuelea. Nafasi za lebo za trafiki husogeza visanduku vya matumizi kando ya kiungo, bila kutegemea nafasi za maoni. Tumia chaguo-msingi cha ramani hufuata Mtindo wa Ramani. Kiungo cha kawaida cha trafiki mara nyingi hakihitaji mabadiliko hapa.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Kuunganisha vyanzo vya trafiki:</strong> Ongeza chanzo cha trafiki huongeza kiolesura kingine kwenye jumla ya ramani, kando kwa NDANI na NJE. Ondoa chanzo huondoa chanzo cha ziada. Badilisha chanzo kikuu kwa kutumia Tumia kiolesura juu. Trafiki iliyojumuishwa hulinganishwa na upana wa bendi uliosanidiwa ili kukokotoa matumizi. Hakuna grafu iliyojumuishwa ya Cacti inayoundwa kiotomatiki; unda grafu ya jumla inayolingana katika Cacti na uweke URL zake za kubofya na kuelea ikihitajika. Viungo tofauti vya ramani mara nyingi huwa wazi zaidi kwa miunganisho mikuu na ya akiba.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Vyanzo na URL za mkono:</strong> Kisanduku cha maandishi cha chanzo huhariri orodha kamili ya vyanzo vilivyopimwa, ikiwemo chanzo kikuu. URL ya lengwa la kubofya hudhibiti mahali ambapo kubofya kiungo cha ramani hupeleka. URL ya grafu kuu ya kuelea huweka mwonekano wa kwanza wa awali; URL za grafu ya ziada hukubali URL moja ya ziada ya picha. Ya ziada hii pia hudhibitiwa chini ya Grafu za ziada za kuelea.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Panga vizuri na Kupitia:</strong> Panga vizuri hurekebisha mpangilio wa kiungo. Kupitia hukuruhusu kuweka sehemu ya kupinda kwenye ramani.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Hariri Usanidi Ghafi:</strong> Hariri sintaksia ya msingi ya ramani kwa mipangilio iliyo zaidi ya fomu hii.</p>"

